    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thats a good start. can u dive a bit deeper into that \"friction\" part? specifically when things go wrong or become unpredictable at these junctions—like why certain designs just seem to fail or cause unexpected congestion spikes despite the math saying they should work?",
